{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198970/extras/Game_Intro_Pengantin_Iblis_ENGLISH.png?t=1749788252\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You must save your niece, Nina, while escaping the merciless the Demon Bride You have 5 days to find her and escape before it\u2019s too late. Will you survive or become her next victim?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198970/extras/Untitled_design.gif?t=1749788252\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198970/extras/ENG_-_1.png?t=1749788252\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hide and outsmart the Demon Bride. Watch your step! Every move counts to stay alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198970/extras/ENG_-_4.png?t=1749788252\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Uncover the mystery to help you escape. Use the items around you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198970/extras/Untitled_desigasdsadn__1_.gif?t=1749788252\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198970/extras/ENG_-_3.png?t=1749788252\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy retro graphics reminiscent of classic games, delivering a deep sense of nostalgia and a chilling horror atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198970/extras/ENG_-_2.png?t=1749788252\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience a gripping horror atmosphere inspired by local Indonesian folklore and stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198970/extras/sdfsdfsdfds.gif?t=1749788252\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198970/extras/Text_Page.png?t=1749788252\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from three characters, each with unique abilities and strategies. Can you save Nina and escape in time?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3198970?t=1749788252","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198970/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749788252","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198970/c67008f8ae0864bf3450df35cc3331dcf4ac4280/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749788252","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198970/c67008f8ae0864bf3450df35cc3331dcf4ac4280/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749788252","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Captions available","id":13}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198970/extras/Game_Intro_Pengantin_Iblis_ENGLISH.png?t=1749788252\"